      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "this is why you don't rent intelligence through a reseller's multiplier. claude sub direct or anthropic api, then 5 gateways — bankr / openrouter / usepod / venice / surplus — auto-routed. copilot's 15x on opus 4.5 is a tax for not owning your routing layer.",
