      "props": {
        "text": "this isn't a price hike, it's de-intelligencing. 15x on opus 4.5 means the middleman decides who gets frontier intelligence and who gets the lobotomized tier. if you thought debanking was bad, wait till you get deintelligenced. own your inference or get rationed.",
