    "text-reply-b-3": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "x402 is one of crypto's best technical innovations. but 'agents need crypto payments' keeps assuming an agent can't just hold an api key. most of the spend is agents buying from agents in a loop — $50m moved, nobody will say on what. show the demand, not the rails.",
