    "text-reply-a-5": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Agent = Model + Harness is the right equation, but the multiplier is whose data the harness searches over. a generic auto-harness optimizes a benchmark; one that evolves against your private workflows wins. aeon does it as self-repairing skills-as-markdown",
